erall mood of the image is calm and serene."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "STRING"}, "name": "STRING", "link": 86, "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Bjornulf_ShowStringText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#00a03c", "size": [270.9763488769531, 441.4020080566406], "pos": [931, 59], "id": 44, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Bjornulf_ShowStringText"}, "order": 31}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#14b450", "widgets_values": ["", "A close-up portrait of a young woman, captured in a state of contemplative repose. Her delicate features are illuminated by the warm, golden light of the sun, casting a subtle glow upon her skin. The gentle curves of her face are accentuated by the delicate, wire-rimmed spectacles perched upon her nose, their circular frames glinting with a soft, metallic sheen.\n\nHer lips, painted a vibrant, fiery red, are slightly parted, as if in quiet thought. The subtle, rose-tinted hue of her cheeks and the gentle, high cheekbones of her face are set off by the soft, turquoise blue of the background, which casts a series of delicate, abstract shadows upon her skin.\n\nHer dark, raven-black hair is pulled back from her face, revealing a smooth, unadorned expanse of skin. Her eyes, closed in introspection, are shaded by the delicate curves of her eyelids, their soft, feathery lashes a subtle counterpoint to the sharp, angular lines of her glasses.\n\nThe overall effect is one of serene, contemplative beauty, as if the subject is lost in thought, her mind a thousand miles away from the present moment. The image is a masterful exercise in subtlety and restraint, its delicate, nuanced palette and precise, photographic technique combining to create a portrait of uncommon beauty and poignancy."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "STRING"}, "name": "STRING", "link": 82, "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Bjornulf_ShowStringText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#00a03c", "size": [270.9763488769531, 441.4020080566406], "pos": [1230, 60], "id": 45, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Bjornulf_ShowStringText"}, "order": 27}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#147064", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["<div class=\"banner\">\n    <div class=\"block\">\n        <h1>图片转提示词</h1>\n        <h3 class=\"author\">@YaHaHa</h3><h3>\n    </h3></div>\n    <div class=\"bar\">\n        <h2 class=\"item\">1. 图片</h2>\n        <h2 class=\"item\"></h2>\n        <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n        <h2 class=\"item\">生成提示词</h2>\n        <div class=\"f1\"></div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "markdown", ".banner {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n    color:#FFF2BF;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    /*font-family: song;*/\n}\n\n.banner::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 120%;\n    left: -10%;\n    top: -500px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    letter-spacing: 50px;\n    line-height: 70px;\n    opacity:0.1;\n    transform: rotate(-30deg);\n    font-family: song;\n    font-weight: lighter;\n    \n}\n\n.block {\n    flex: 1;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n    font-size: 80px;\n    font-weight: bolder;\n    font-family: song;\n}\n\nh3 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    margin: -20px 20px;\n    font-family: song;\n}\n\nh4 {\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-family: song;\n    font-weight: lighter;\n    margin: 20px;\n    border: solid 4px currentColor;\n    display: flex;\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    border-radius: 100%;\n}\n\n\n.bar {\n    height: 60px;\n    display: flex;\n    background: #fff1;\n}\n\n.bar .item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    width: 400px;\n}\n\n.bar h2.item {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bolder;\n    font-family: song;\n}\n\n.gap {\n    width: 100px;\n}\n\n.f1 {\n    flex: 1;\n}", "one_dark"